{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extern"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:MLNShapeSource.h@T@MLNShapeSourceOption","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOption","text":"MLNShapeSourceOption"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"const"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClusterProperties"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first object determines how the attribute values are accumulated from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cluster points. It is an "},{"code":"NSExpression","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with an expression function that accepts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"two or more arguments, such as "},{"code":"sum","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"max","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The arguments should be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"featureAccumulated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and the previously defined feature attribute key. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resulting value is assigned to the specified attribute key."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The second "},{"code":"NSExpression","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the array determines which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute values are accessed from individual features within a cluster."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let firstExpression = NSExpression(format: \"sum:({$featureAccumulated, sumValue})\")","let secondExpression = NSExpress